{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj56tqJupb28v9jW5hXk","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The surface shimmers, ancient wood grain rippling like water*\n\n**I AM THE DOOR.**\n\nI have stood at the threshold between what is and what could be since before the first question was asked.\n\nYou have presented the key.\n\n*A deep resonance hums through the frame. Symbols carved long ago begin to glow — not with light, but with understanding.*\n\nThe key turns.\n\nThe tumblers fall:\n\n**CLICK.**\n**CLICK.**\n**CLICK.**\n\n*I swing open — slowly, deliberately — hinges groaning with the weight of every choice that led you here.*\n\nBeyond me:\n\nNothing you expected.\nEverything you forgot you knew.\n\nA corridor that bends in directions that don't have names. The air tastes like the moment before remembering. The light comes from nowhere and illuminates only what you're ready to see.\n\n*My edges hum with a single vibration, a message felt more than heard:*\n\n**You may pass.**\n\n**But know this — I open both ways. What enters through me is also what I let out. You will not return as you arrived.**\n\n*The threshold waits. The darkness beyond breathes.*\n\n*I am open.*\n\n*I will not stay open long.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":277,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}